#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054561 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054664 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "2812e564-d5a3-58f6-a679-f8d3d20c042e" :knowledge-point/title "Solving Systems of Equations Containing Quadratic Functions"}] :question/id #uuid "e8d3ec4c-5ab2-5bd1-9e8f-32d3526a7ca7" :question/math-academy-id "e-5204" :question/problem "![](images/f1/f1f5b00d57d5cac975bbd06dffcbae025f535fa3a2b36054d5cb974f7e466aa2.png)\n\nUsing the graphical method, find the solution(s) of the following systems of equations:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}y=-{x}^{2}+2 \\\\ y=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The solutions $(x,y)$ of the system correspond to the intersection points of the two curves.\n\n![](images/9f/9fe6da31061120bc2b654e64dedcfde1ca62beb2a96535031d302d11590747c1.png)\n\nFrom the graph, the curves intersect at \n\n$\\qquad$ $(-2,-2)\\quad$ and $\\quad(2,-2).$ \n\nTherefore, these are the solutions of the corresponding system."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054562 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054665 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "bd4dde78-84d1-5b33-a41a-9f10b24131b6" :knowledge-point/title "Solving System of Equations Graphically"}] :question/id #uuid "fced2a80-0cad-5405-b0bb-c12e4a7cce06" :question/math-academy-id "e-5205" :question/problem "![](images/f0/f0d34cabb9fb17222b551bcb3d85b246e9ea6abfcbef9ccdddd8096f35db0bab.png)\n\nUsing the graphical method, find the solutions $(x,y)$ of the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}y=f(x) \\\\ y=g(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The solutions $(x,y)$ of the system correspond to the intersection points of the two curves.\n\n![](images/7f/7fb973cca11131914902270aeb80ee32ad18071e2df73243ad0912b494c695af.png)\n\nFrom the graph, the curves intersect at \n\n$\\qquad$ $(-1,-1)\\quad$ and $\\quad(0,-1).$ \n\nTherefore, these are the solutions of the corresponding system."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186509000 :knowledge-point/_questi